  "description": "A creation time as read from the filesystem, in seconds and nanoseconds since the Unix epoch, into btime_ns. It is absent when it is exactly 0 or does not fit in a signed 64-bit count of nanoseconds. The nanoseconds run from 0 to 999999999, also before the epoch.",
